{
  "claim": "The product ships an AI co-pilot that consumes the same app graph, so the graph must be able to say which data is sensitive before a projection reads it.",
  "v8Finding": 27,
  "violation": "A Data Sources catalog advertises live draft Response state (SSN, DOB) at the co-pilot slot and a webhook signing secret to the co-pilot module, with no field anywhere marking either as sensitive. A fourth source points at a nonexistent route/slot as a control.",
